4. Learning System
This is one of the most important parts of the MVP.
Lesson capabilities
Each lesson needs:
Lesson title
Short explanation
Visual/example
Interactive question or quiz
Completion status
Next lesson button
Keep lessons very short, around 1–3 minutes.
MVP lessons
I would only build 3 lessons for the demo:
What Is the Stock Market? (“Opener”)
What Is a Stock? (“Lesson 1”)
Buying & Selling Stocks (“Lesson 2”)
You can add more later.

5. Quiz System
After each lesson:
Display 1–3 questions
User selects an answer
Give immediate feedback
Mark lesson as complete
Unlock the next capability
Example:
What does it mean when you buy a share of a company?
A. You are lending the company money
B. You own a small portion of the company
C. You guarantee that the company will make money
D. You are buying a product from the company
Correct!
A share represents a small ownership stake in a company.

